        <mxCell id="T6I3gG0kRrgbXN8CNnat-1" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Browse Products&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;&quot;&gt;User can browse products by selecting different categories. If no products in a category, it display no products available. In each category, the user can filter products by &quot;tags&quot;. One or more filter can be selected. If no filters are selected, all products in that category are shown.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
