        <mxCell id="T6I3gG0kRrgbXN8CNnat-2" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;View Product Details&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;&quot;&gt;Clicking a product brings up the product&#39;s details. There should be: Name, Description, Price and options. When an option is changed, the price should reflect the option price. The carousel should behave as you&#39;d expect a carousel to.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
