        <mxCell id="T6I3gG0kRrgbXN8CNnat-17" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Cart&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;&quot;&gt;The cart lists products in cart. Product card shows: Name, selected option, and price. A trashcan icon is in upper right. The Order Summary shows: cart subtotal, shipping (is flat rate) and total.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Checkout button is disabled unless 1 or more products in their cart.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
