        <mxCell id="T6I3gG0kRrgbXN8CNnat-45" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;&quot;&gt;Step 2: enter address information. All fields are required. Clicking &quot;Next&quot; shows error if field is missing. When valid, &quot;Next&quot; moves to step 3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(153, 76, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Database:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(153, 76, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;customer Table -&amp;gt; values should match the name &amp;amp; address entered.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
